# gate-select.py (plan 5.17.5 and 5.17.7, M24) selects the change-dependent
# steps of a milestone gate. 'harness [--base REV]' prints 'harness: run' and
# the changed harness files, sorted, or 'harness: skip'; 'expected-dirs
# [--base REV]' prints each directory under msil/test (outside Inputs/ and
# Output/) that holds an added or changed .c, .ll, .test or .expected file.
# The change set is 'git diff --name-only <base>' (default HEAD) plus 'git
# status --porcelain --untracked-files=all'. Harness files: msil/utils/**
# except msil/utils/corpus/manifest.json and msil/utils/upstream-hooks.txt;
# msil/test/lit.cfg.py and msil/test/lit.site.cfg.py.in; every lit.local.cfg
# and .py file under msil/test; msil/test/harness/**.
# (1) --self-test passes every case.
# (2) In a scratch repository with one commit (Inputs/git-scratch.py, which
# also runs gate-select.py with --repo): (a) no change: 'harness: skip' and no
# directory. (b) Changes outside the harness (the two excluded msil/utils
# files, an LLVM source, a test, a text file under msil/test): skip, and
# expected-dirs names the test's directory alone. (c) Harness files changed,
# staged and untracked (under msil/utils, lit.cfg.py, lit.site.cfg.py.in, a
# lit.local.cfg, a .py file under an Inputs/ directory, a new file under
# msil/test/harness) and a test of each kind, also under Inputs/ and Output/:
# 'harness: run' with exactly the harness files, and the directories of the
# tests outside Inputs/ and Output/. (d) After a commit of all of it: skip
# against HEAD, and the lists of (c) with --base HEAD~1. (e) A deleted
# harness file: run, naming it; a deleted test: no directory.
# (3) A --base that git does not know and a --repo that is no repository exit
# 1 with git's message; usage errors exit 2.
# REQUIRES: msil-git

# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t

# (1)
# RUN: %python %S/../../../utils/ci/gate-select.py --self-test > %t/1.log
# RUN: %{harness_check} contains %t/1.log "\Agate-select: self-test: (\d+) of \1 cases passed\n\Z"

# (2a)
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/git-scratch.py init %t/repo msil/utils/ci/lit-legs.ps1 msil/utils/corpus/manifest.json msil/utils/upstream-hooks.txt msil/test/lit.cfg.py msil/test/lit.site.cfg.py.in msil/test/M1/lit.local.cfg msil/test/M1/03-control/loops.c msil/test/M1/03-control/old.c msil/test/M2/Inputs/helper.py msil/test/harness/a.test llvm/lib/x.cpp
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/git-scratch.py select %t/repo harness > %t/2a.log
# RUN: %{harness_check} contains %t/2a.log "\Aharness: skip\n\Z"
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/git-scratch.py select %t/repo expected-dirs > %t/2a-dirs.log
# RUN: %{harness_check} equals %t/2a-dirs.log

